These devices were installed since 2006 all over Russia (mostly
in block houses):

http://wiki.tekon.ru/index.php?title=%D0%9A%D0%A3%D0%9D-IPM
http://wiki.tekon.ru/index.php?title=%D0%A4%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BB:Kun_ipmv1.jpg
